        "nameEn": "Negative descriptions of groups in the Qur'an",
        "color": "yellow",
        "items": [
          {
            "ar": "الْأَسْفَلِينَ",
            "en": "the lowest",
            "ref": "37:98",
            "verse": "فَأَرَادُوا۟ بِهِۦ كَيْدًۭا فَجَعَلْنَـٰهُمُ ٱلْأَسْفَلِينَ",
            "verseEn": "And they intended for him a plan [i.e., harm], but We made them the most debased."
          },
          {
            "ar": "الْأَرْذَلُونَ",
            "en": "the lowest",
            "ref": "26:111",
            "verse": "۞ قَالُوٓا۟ أَنُؤْمِنُ لَكَ وَٱتَّبَعَكَ ٱلْأَرْذَلُونَ",
            "verseEn": "They said, \"Should we believe you while you are followed by the lowest [class of people]?\""
          },
          {
            "ar": "جَبَّارِينَ",
            "en": "(as) tyrants",
            "ref": "26:130",
            "verse": "وَإِذَا بَطَشْتُم بَطَشْتُمْ جَبَّارِينَ",
            "verseEn": "And when you strike, you strike as tyrants."
          },
          {
            "ar": "كَاذِبُونَ",
            "en": "(are) liars",
            "ref": "26:223",
            "verse": "يُلْقُونَ ٱلسَّمْعَ وَأَكْثَرُهُمْ كَـٰذِبُونَ",
            "verseEn": "They pass on what is heard, and most of them are liars."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "أَفْعَالُ الْأَمْرِ فِي الْقُرْآنِ",
        "nameEn": "Imperative Verbs in the Qur'an",
        "color": "green",
        "items": [
          {
            "ar": "اخْفِضْ",
            "en": "And lower",
            "ref": "26:215",
            "verse": "وَٱخْفِضْ جَنَاحَكَ لِمَنِ ٱتَّبَعَكَ مِنَ ٱلْمُؤْمِنِينَ",
            "verseEn": "And lower your wing [i.e., show kindness] to those who follow you of the believers."
          },
          {
            "ar": "تَوَكَّلْ",
            "en": "And put (your) trust",
            "ref": "26:217",
            "verse": "وَتَوَكَّلْ عَلَى ٱلْعَزِيزِ ٱلرَّحِيمِ",
            "verseEn": "And rely upon the Exalted in Might, the Merciful,"
          },
          {
            "ar": "تَوَلَّ",
            "en": "So turn away",
            "ref": "37:174",
            "verse": "فَتَوَلَّ عَنْهُمْ حَتَّىٰ حِينٍۢ",
            "verseEn": "So, [O Muḥammad], leave them for a time."
          },
          {
            "ar": "أَبْصِرْهُمْ",
            "en": "And see them",
            "ref": "37:175",
            "verse": "وَأَبْصِرْهُمْ فَسَوْفَ يُبْصِرُونَ",
            "verseEn": "And see [what will befall] them, for they are going to see."
          }
        ]
      },
